<div id="main">
	<div class="midashi">
		<h2>Admission</h2>
	<div class="clearboth"></div>
</div>
	
<div class="container ticket">
		<h3>Admission</h3>
		<table>
			<tr>
				<th class="omidashi">Tickets</th>
				<th class="omidashi">&nbsp;</th>
				<th class="omidashi">Adults<span>(15-64)</span></th>
				<th class="omidashi">Children<span>(0-14 and students up to 18)</span></th>
				<th class="omidashi">Senior<span>(65+)</span></th>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<th class="kmidashi1">Individual Tickets</th>
				<td>&nbsp;</td>
				<td class="price">&yen;500</td>
				<td class="price">free of charge</td>
				<td class="price">&yen;200</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<th class="kmidashi2">Group (20 or more)</th>
				<td>&nbsp;</td>
				<td class="price">&yen;400</td>
				<td class="price">free of charge</td>
				<td class="price">&yen;160</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<th rowspan="4" class="kmidashi3">Combined Tickets</th>
				<td>Korakuen + <a href="https://www.pref.okayama.jp/site/kenhaku/628008.html" target="_blank">Okayama Prefectural Museum</a></td>
				<td class="price">&yen;610</td>
				<td class="price">-</td>
				<td class="price">-</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td>Korakuen + <a href="https://okayama-kanko.net/ujo/english/index.html" target="_blank">Okayama Castle</a></td>
				<td class="price">&yen;800</td>
				<td class="price">-&nbsp;</td>
				<td class="price">-</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td>Korakuen + <a href="https://okayama-kanko.net/ujo/english/index.html" target="_blank">Okayama Castle</a> + <a href="http://www.hayashibara-museumofart.jp/data/en/" target="_blank">Hayashibara Museum of Art</a></td>
				<td class="price">&yen;1.280</td>
				<td class="price">-</td>
				<td class="price">-</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="4"><ul>
					<li>- Combined tickets are not available on other facilities’ closing days or during special exhibitions, etc. Please check the website for more detailed information.</li>
					<li>- Void if the ticket is lost.</li>
					<li>- Re-entry is not permitted. Please ask the staff at the gate if you re-enter.</li>
					<li>- Admission for children up to 14 y.o. is free of charge at Okayama Korakuen Gardern, Okayama Prefectural Museum and Hayashibara Art Museum, hence no combined ticket is necessary for these facilities.</li>
					<li>- Admission for students (including international students) up to 18 y.o. is temporarily free of charge at Okayama Korakuen Garden; please provide a school booklet or any document proving the school attendance.</li>
					
				</ul></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<th class="kmidashi4">Payment Options</th>
				<td colspan="4"><ul>
					<li>- Cash (Japanese yen only).</li>
					<li>- Credit cards: JCB, VISA, Mastercard, Diners Club, American Express, Discover, China UnionPay.</li>
					<li>- E-commerce payment systmes: QUICPay, iD, nanaco, Rakuten Edy, WAON, Japanese prepaid transportation smart cards (ICOCA, Suica, etcetera).</li>
					<li>- Electronic payments: PayPay, Rakuten Pay, d-Barai, auPAY.</li>
				</ul></td>
			</tr>
		</table>
	</div>

