			<dd>Admission of people age 65 and over with the evidence of their ages to present  E.g. health insurance card, ID card, passport and othes.</dd>
		</dl>
	</div>
-->

	<div class="container opentime">
		<h3>Hours</h3>
		<p class="open">March 20 to September 30<span>7:30 – 18:00 (last admission 17:45)</span></p>
		<p class="open">October 1 to March 19<span>8:00 – 17:00 (last admission 16:45)</span></p>
	</div>

	<div class="container pamphlet" id="pamphlet">
		<h3>Pamphlet Download</h3>
		<div class="pamphdl">
			<p class="pamphtext">Pamphlets are available in the following languages:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><a href="https://okayama-korakuen.jp/material/files/group/3/japanese2024.pdf" class="jp">Japanese</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://okayama-korakuen.jp/material/files/group/3/english2024.pdf" class="en">English</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://okayama-korakuen.jp/material/files/group/3/french2024.pdf" class="fr">French</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://okayama-korakuen.jp/material/files/group/3/korean2024.pdf" class="kr">Korean</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://okayama-korakuen.jp/material/files/group/3/chinesekantai2024.pdf" class="cn">Chinese (simplified)</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://okayama-korakuen.jp/material/files/group/3/chinesehantai2024.pdf" class="tw">Chinese (traditional)</a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<p class="pamphimg"><img src="../../common/images/pamphlet.gif" alt="Pamphlet" width="265" height="232" /></p>
		<div class="clearboth"></div>
	</div>

	<img src="shooting.gif">
		<h3>About Shooting for Commercial Use</h3>
		<p class="shooting">If you would like to shoot pictures and videos for commercial use in Okayama Korakuen Garden, you need to apply for permission to do it in advance. Please contact us at least 10 days before visiting the garden.
	</div>
	
		<div class="clearboth"></div>
	</div>

	<div class="container about">
		<h3>Enquiries</h3>
		<p class="name"><b>Okayama Korakuen Garden Office</b></p>
		<p class="address">・Address: 1-5 Korakuen, Kita-ku, Okayama City, Okayama 703-8257 JAPAN<br />・Phone: (+81) 086-272-1148 <span class="text-grey">(Japanese only)</span><br />・Fax: (+81) 086-272-1147 <span class="text-grey">(Japanese and English)</span><br />・E-Mail: <a href="https://www.pref.okayama.jp/form/detail.php?sec_sec1=211&check" target="_blank">click here</a> and fill the form with your name, e-mail address (twice for confirmation), address, phone number, object and request. All the fields are mandatory. <span class="text-grey">(Japanese and English)</span><br />・Social networks: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/okayamakorakuen" target="_blank">Facebook</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/okayamakorakuen/" target="_blank">Instagram</a> <span class="text-grey">(Japanese and English)</span></p>
	</div>
	
